WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.095 --> 00:00:14.856
awoke after a restless night.

2
00:00:15.496 --> 00:00:17.856
When she opened her eyes, she was confused.

3
00:00:18.697 --> 00:00:19.557
"Where am I?"

4
00:00:20.197 --> 00:00:20.657
she thought.

5
00:00:21.297 --> 00:00:22.498
Then she remembered.

6
00:00:22.518 --> 00:00:23.678
"Oh yeah.

7
00:00:24.098 --> 00:00:25.879
Zann and I are trapped in Terrica."

8
00:00:26.519 --> 00:00:32.434
The evening before, Mellis had taken them to her bedroom, which contained only a thick mat stuffed with

9
00:00:32.534 --> 00:00:37.797
straw. She and Vilkor had brought in similar straw beds for Perda and Zann.

10
00:00:38.418 --> 00:00:39.879
Perda sat up and yawned.

11
00:00:40.519 --> 00:00:41.660
Zann was still asleep.

12
00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.341
But Mellis was awake.

13
00:00:43.902 --> 00:00:46.283
She was searching the floor in the corners of the room.

14
00:00:46.303 --> 00:00:48.685
"What are you looking for?"

15
00:00:49.205 --> 00:00:50.526
Perda asked sleepily.

16
00:00:51.147 --> 00:00:53.168
Mellis straightened up, looking anxious.

17
00:00:53.748 --> 00:00:56.190
Before she could answer, the door flew open.

18
00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:58.972
"Time to get moving," Vilkor announced.

19
00:00:59.624 --> 00:01:02.006
"Mellis, you quit digging earlier yesterday.

20
00:01:02.807 --> 00:01:04.788
I hope you'll make up the time today."

21
00:01:05.549 --> 00:01:06.830
Zann finally woke up.

22
00:01:07.591 --> 00:01:08.672
"Where am I?"

23
00:01:09.112 --> 00:01:09.652
he mumbled.

24
00:01:09.672 --> 00:01:13.696
"Zann and I will help her dig the well," Perda told Vilkor.

25
00:01:13.716 --> 00:01:17.319
"After all, it was our fault she had to stop yesterday."

26
00:01:17.339 --> 00:01:18.940
"You will?"

27
00:01:19.641 --> 00:01:20.922
Vilkor looked impressed.

28
00:01:21.762 --> 00:01:26.506
"Wonderful! I'll make sure you all have a double helping of porridge for breakfast."

29
00:01:26.526 --> 00:01:30.657
"Thanks," Mellis said after her uncle left.

30
00:01:30.677 --> 00:01:32.958
"You don't really have to help dig."

31
00:01:32.978 --> 00:01:34.319
"We don't mind."

32
00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.921
Zann appeared fully awake by now.

33
00:01:37.481 --> 00:01:39.842
He nudged Zing with his foot to wake him up.

34
00:01:40.963 --> 00:01:45.206
After two helpings of porridge, they started the long hike to the well site.

35
00:01:45.826 --> 00:01:51.129
Zann carried Zing until they were out of sight of the farmhouse and then released him from the

36
00:01:51.169 --> 00:01:55.992
bag. The girls carried an assortment of tools.

37
00:01:56.680 --> 00:02:00.122
"Why did you decide to dig your new well so far from the farmhouse?"

38
00:02:00.542 --> 00:02:01.143
Perda asked.

39
00:02:01.883 --> 00:02:04.444
"Won't it be difficult to haul water so far?"

40
00:02:04.465 --> 00:02:09.227
"Yes, but water is scarce in this part of Terrica," Mellis explained.

41
00:02:09.247 --> 00:02:14.250
"My uncle noticed that small tree and figured there must be water in that spot.

42
00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:19.393
He suggested I pull out the tree and dig the well exactly where it was growing.

43
00:02:20.093 --> 00:02:22.114
But I didn't have the heart to do that.

44
00:02:22.995 --> 00:02:24.576
I dug next to it instead."

45
00:02:25.388 --> 00:02:26.409
Perda shook her head.

46
00:02:26.429 --> 00:02:31.592
"It's strange to think how different things are here from back home in Magica.

47
00:02:32.212 --> 00:02:34.153
We just conjure whatever we need."

48
00:02:35.113 --> 00:02:36.975
Mellis shot her a sidelong look.

49
00:02:36.995 --> 00:02:39.876
"Will you tell me more about Magica?

50
00:02:40.597 --> 00:02:44.319
I still don't understand where it is or how you got here."

51
00:02:44.339 --> 00:02:46.480
"Sure," Zann said.

52
00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.341
"Magica is great!

53
00:02:48.781 --> 00:02:49.822
Well, it usually is.

54
00:02:50.362 --> 00:02:55.761
Not long ago this evil guy named Morb decided to take over, and He told Mellis the whole

55
00:02:55.882 --> 00:02:57.583
story, with Perda helping.

56
00:02:58.204 --> 00:03:00.486
Mellis' eyes grew wide as she listened.

57
00:03:00.986 --> 00:03:03.449
Perda wondered if she believed what they were telling her.

58
00:03:04.349 --> 00:03:06.331
Finally they reached the well site.

59
00:03:06.972 --> 00:03:08.353
The day was growing hotter.

60
00:03:09.014 --> 00:03:11.296
Zann mopped his brow with the back of his arm.

61
00:03:11.316 --> 00:03:13.798
"We'd better start digging," he said.

62
00:03:13.818 --> 00:03:16.761
"Wait." Perda dropped her shovel.

63
00:03:16.781 --> 00:03:19.944
"First let's try to open the wormhole again."

64
00:03:20.828 --> 00:03:24.572
She and Zann went to the spot where they'd emerged from the wormhole.

65
00:03:25.112 --> 00:03:26.614
But it still didn't appear.

66
00:03:32.439 --> 00:03:35.422
stop wasting energy," Perda said at last.

67
00:03:36.203 --> 00:03:37.624
Mellis was already digging.

68
00:03:38.125 --> 00:03:41.148
Perda and Zann each picked up a shovel and joined her.

69
00:03:41.828 --> 00:03:45.512
Soon the three of them had scooped out a wide but shallow hole.

70
00:03:46.048 --> 00:03:50.051
By the time they stopped to eat lunch, the hole was as deep as the height of a

71
00:03:50.132 --> 00:03:50.812
tall man.

72
00:03:50.832 --> 00:03:52.373
"This is great."

73
00:03:53.114 --> 00:03:55.256
Mellis peered into the dark, damp hole.

74
00:03:55.276 --> 00:03:59.279
"With all three of us working, we might strike water today!

75
00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:03.422
Uncle Vilkor will be so pleased if that happens."

76
00:04:04.383 --> 00:04:09.167
"Uncle Vilkor could make it happen faster if he picked up a shovel himself," Zann grumbled.

77
00:04:09.888 --> 00:04:11.809
Perda was too tired to say anything.

78
00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:14.652
Every muscle in her body was sore.

79
00:04:15.296 --> 00:04:17.097
Her throat ached with thirst.

80
00:04:17.697 --> 00:04:21.679
She imagined gulping down a tall, cool glass of airberry juice.

81
00:04:22.319 --> 00:04:23.960
Mellis finished her lunch quickly.

82
00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:26.821
"I'll take a turn in the hole," she said.

83
00:04:26.841 --> 00:04:29.322
"Can one of you please help me get down there?"

84
00:04:30.362 --> 00:04:36.565
Zann climbed to his feet and held onto Mellis' hands, lowering her into the hole until she could

85
00:04:36.645 --> 00:04:37.685
safely drop down.

86
00:04:37.705 --> 00:04:44.668
"I wonder if there's enough magic energy to make a pitcher of airberry juice," Perda said as Zann

87
00:04:44.768 --> 00:04:46.249
flopped down beside her again.

88
00:04:46.269 --> 00:04:47.930
"Should we try?"

89
00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:49.670
Zann groaned.

90
00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:54.692
"I'm not sure I have enough strength to create friction," he said.

91
00:04:54.712 --> 00:04:59.034
"It does sound tasty though, so—" "Hey!"

92
00:04:59.534 --> 00:05:01.015
Mellis called up from the hole.

93
00:05:01.035 --> 00:05:03.356
"Could one of you hand me the ax?

94
00:05:04.216 --> 00:05:05.577
I've hit a big root."

95
00:05:06.517 --> 00:05:11.139
That made Perda curious enough to stand up and grab the ax from Mellis' bag.

96
00:05:11.159 --> 00:05:12.439
"A root?

97
00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:13.880
From what?"

98
00:05:14.344 --> 00:05:16.245
she asked as she peered into the hole.

99
00:05:17.005 --> 00:05:18.485
Mellis looked up and shrugged.

100
00:05:18.505 --> 00:05:19.946
"I'm not sure.

101
00:05:20.666 --> 00:05:22.906
It's too big to belong to that tiny tree.

102
00:05:23.747 --> 00:05:25.987
Maybe there was a larger tree here once."

103
00:05:26.887 --> 00:05:29.408
Perda carefully handed the ax down to Mellis.

104
00:05:29.428 --> 00:05:31.909
"Have you hit any water yet?"

105
00:05:31.929 --> 00:05:33.969
"No," Mellis said.

106
00:05:33.989 --> 00:05:36.150
"But the dirt is getting quite damp.

107
00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.190
I think we're very close."

108
00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:41.671
"Cool." Zann kneeled next to Perda.

109
00:05:42.291 --> 00:05:43.932
"I'll take the next turn down there if you want."

110
00:05:44.688 --> 00:05:45.528
Mellis nodded.

111
00:05:46.128 --> 00:05:50.410
She hoisted the ax and swung it at a gnarled root at the bottom of the hole.

112
00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:54.551
Once, twice, then "Whoa!"

113
00:05:55.151 --> 00:05:56.591
Mellis cried, falling back.

114
00:05:57.351 --> 00:06:00.432
Perda felt something come rushing up and out of the well.

115
00:06:01.132 --> 00:06:05.854
It wasn't water, but a mighty swirling rainbow of light and air.

116
00:06:06.474 --> 00:06:11.515
It roared up and filled the air so that Perda could barely see Zann beside her.

117
00:06:11.535 --> 00:06:13.216
"What's happening?"

118
00:06:13.536 --> 00:06:14.196
Zann shouted.

119
00:06:14.884 --> 00:06:16.025
Perda couldn't answer.

120
00:06:16.745 --> 00:06:18.886
For a second she was terrified.

121
00:06:19.506 --> 00:06:23.668
Then she gasped as she felt sudden strength course through her.

122
00:06:24.468 --> 00:06:28.050
Could it be Acting on a hunch, she snapped her fingers.

123
00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:32.732
An overflowing pitcher of airberry juice appeared in front of her.

124
00:06:33.372 --> 00:06:37.974
And then another, and another, spilling juice onto the dusty ground.

125
00:06:37.994 --> 00:06:40.175
"Zann!" she cried.

126
00:06:40.195 --> 00:06:42.356
"It's magic energy!"
